  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1768700228_7493845_3f34949d8c2c9dd7960f474805c8746e.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">JD4M IL4H is a faith based brand that stands for “Jesus Died for Me, I Live for Him.”  We believe that apparel is more than just fabric, it's a conversation starter and a testimony.  We create modern, high-quality JD4M IL4H branded shirts, hats, jewelry, and accessories that are faith based and designed to share Jesus with the world.  We want people to be bold in their faith.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">We are looking for passionate Christian/Faith Based Creators, leaders, and daily disciples to join our ambassador program.  Whether you have 1,000 followers or 100,000, if you love Jesus and love stylish gear, we want to partner with you to help spread the word.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Who We're Looking For:</span></p><ul><li style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Faith-based lifestyle influencers.</li><li style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">UGC creators who love making unboxing and \"fit check\" videos.</li><li style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Anyone dedicated to sharing the Gospel through their daily life.</li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">About our products:  </span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Our shirts are premium pre-shrunk shirts with “soft print” graphics so the graphics are dyed into the shirt so there is no peeling.  Our designs are made by us so they are unique and exclusive and a great way to bring people to Jesus.  Our hats, jewelry, and other accessories are high premium quality and details about each can be found out our website at JD4M.com.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Affiliates can earn commissions through shared promo code and affiliate links.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Apply today and let's make a difference together!  All for His glory!<br></span></p></div></div>",
