  "term_and_condition": "<div style=\"font-family:Jost;\"><p style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36);font-family:'Segoe UI', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 16.1px;\"><b>JD4M IL4H Brand Ambassador Agreement</b></p><p style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36);font-family:'Segoe UI', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 12px;\">This Brand Ambassador Agreement (“Agreement”) is entered into as of the date of acceptance when submitting this application, by and between JD4M IL4H, LLC (\"JD4M\" or “Company”) and the undersigned Brand Ambassador (“Ambassador”).</p><p style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36);font-family:'Segoe UI', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 14.9px;\"><strong>1. Purpose</strong></p><p style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36);font-family:'Segoe UI', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 12px;\">JD4M IL4H is a Christian apparel brand with the mission of spreading the Gospel of Jesus Christ through faith-based merchandise. The Ambassador desires to support this mission by representing JD4M in a positive, Christ-honoring manner.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36);font-family:'Segoe UI', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 14.9px;\"><strong>2. Ambassador Relationship</strong></p><ul style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36);font-family:'Segoe UI', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;list-style-type:disc;\"><li style=\"font-family:Aptos, 'Aptos_MSFontService', '-apple-system', Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 12px;\">The Ambassador is an independent contractor, not an employee, partner, or agent of JD4M.</li><li style=\"font-family:Aptos, 'Aptos_MSFontService', '-apple-system', Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 12px;\">This Agreement does not create any employment, joint venture, or legal partnership.</li></ul><p style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36);font-family:'Segoe UI', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 14.9px;\"><strong>3. Ambassador Responsibilities</strong></p><p style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36);font-family:'Segoe UI', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 12px;\">The Ambassador agrees to:</p><ul style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36);font-family:'Segoe UI', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;list-style-type:disc;\"><li style=\"font-family:Aptos, 'Aptos_MSFontService', '-apple-system', Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 12px;\">Represent JD4M in a respectful, honest, and Christ-like manner.</li><li style=\"font-family:Aptos, 'Aptos_MSFontService', '-apple-system', Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 12px;\">Share JD4M products organically through personal use, word-of-mouth, social media, blogs, websites, and/or events.</li><li style=\"font-family:Aptos, 'Aptos_MSFontService', '-apple-system', Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 12px;\">Avoid false or misleading statements about JD4M, its products, or its mission.</li><li style=\"font-family:Aptos, 'Aptos_MSFontService', '-apple-system', Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 12px;\">Comply with all applicable laws, including FTC disclosure guidelines (e.g., using #JD4Mambassador, #ad, #sponsored or #Gifted when applicable).</li></ul><p style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36);font-family:'Segoe UI', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 12px;min-height:13.8px;\"><strong>4. Free Products / Compensation</strong></p><ul style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36);font-family:'Segoe UI', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;list-style-type:disc;\"><li style=\"font-family:Aptos, 'Aptos_MSFontService', '-apple-system', Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 12px;\">JD4M may provide the Ambassador with free or discounted products for promotional purposes.</li><li style=\"font-family:Aptos, 'Aptos_MSFontService', '-apple-system', Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 12px;\">Free products are considered gifts and are not wages or taxable compensation unless otherwise required by law.</li><li style=\"font-family:Aptos, 'Aptos_MSFontService', '-apple-system', Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 12px;\">The Ambassador is not guaranteed ongoing free products or compensation.</li></ul><p style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36);font-family:'Segoe UI', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 12px;min-height:13.8px;\"><strong>5. Promo Codes &amp; Donations (If Applicable)</strong></p><ul style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36);font-family:'Segoe UI', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;list-style-type:disc;\"><li style=\"font-family:Aptos, 'Aptos_MSFontService', '-apple-system', Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 12px;\">JD4M may provide a unique promo code and affiliate link tied to the Ambassador.</li><li style=\"font-family:Aptos, 'Aptos_MSFontService', '-apple-system', Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 12px;\">If used, an agreed upon percentage of sales generated through the code may be donated or sponsored in alignment with JD4M’s promotional programs.</li><li style=\"font-family:Aptos, 'Aptos_MSFontService', '-apple-system', Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 12px;\">Donation recipients and duration are determined solely by JD4M.</li></ul><p style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36);font-family:'Segoe UI', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 12px;min-height:13.8px;\"><strong>6. Content Usage Rights</strong></p><ul style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36);font-family:'Segoe UI', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;list-style-type:disc;\"><li style=\"font-family:Aptos, 'Aptos_MSFontService', '-apple-system', Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 12px;\">The Ambassador grants JD4M permission to repost, share, and use submitted photos, videos, or testimonials featuring JD4M products for marketing purposes.</li><li style=\"font-family:Aptos, 'Aptos_MSFontService', '-apple-system', Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 12px;\">JD4M will not alter content in a misleading or inappropriate way.</li></ul><p style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36);font-family:'Segoe UI', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 12px;min-height:13.8px;\"><strong>7. Moral &amp; Faith-Based Clause</strong></p><p style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36);font-family:'Segoe UI', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 12px;\">JD4M reserves the right to terminate this Agreement immediately if the Ambassador engages in behavior or public conduct that is inconsistent with biblical values, Christian values, or the mission of JD4M.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36);font-family:'Segoe UI', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 12px;min-height:13.8px;\"><strong>8. Term &amp; Termination</strong></p><ul style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36);font-family:'Segoe UI', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;list-style-type:disc;\"><li style=\"font-family:Aptos, 'Aptos_MSFontService', '-apple-system', Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 12px;\">This Agreement is effective upon acceptance and continues until terminated.</li><li style=\"font-family:Aptos, 'Aptos_MSFontService', '-apple-system', Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 12px;\">Either party may terminate this Agreement at any time, with or without cause.</li><li style=\"font-family:Aptos, 'Aptos_MSFontService', '-apple-system', Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 12px;\">Upon termination, the Ambassador agrees to discontinue representation of JD4M.</li></ul><p style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36);font-family:'Segoe UI', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 12px;min-height:13.8px;\"><strong>9. Limitation of Liability</strong></p><p style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36);font-family:'Segoe UI', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 12px;\">JD4M shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from participation in the ambassador program.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36);font-family:'Segoe UI', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 12px;min-height:13.8px;\"><strong>10. Governing Law</strong></p><p style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36)